{"id":"u-ccaaf375-5f15-4897-8fcf-2962fd3d5b2a","src":"community","title":"Smart gainz, massiv body","author":"Kevin O.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/smart-gainz-massiv-body","desc":"This is a hypertrophy Plan with an triple Progression. There is not really a limit to the timeframe you could use this template for. Its two workouts you alternate so Workout A and Workout B\n\nIts generally a 3x 8-15 Plan, where you start at 8 Reps ans try to climb up in reps before anything else. Later on, when you have trouble to improve your weights or Reps, you add a set. You can also add a set when you recover extremly well from your workouts. But try not to go above 5 sets. \n\nProgression should look Like this:\n\nWorkout 1 \n3x8,8,8\n\nWorkout 2 \n3x 9,9,9 or 3x 9,8,8\n\nSo you add reps when you are able too and try to get with you choose. Weight Up to 15 Reps in all 3 Sets. Once done, you increse weight by a larger margin and fall back to 8 Reps to start all over. \nThis allows you to milk a weight and you can Progress slowly and Safe. \n\nWhen you get stronger and getting Reps in or you want a changeup, simply add a set.","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:26:23.607Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5},{"r":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5},{"r":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5},{"r":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Upright Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5},{"r":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5},{"r":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lying Tricep Extension (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5},{"r":8,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5},{"r":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pec Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi